{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Queues — v0.1\n\nImplemented per-chat/project/model scheduling.\nTemporary timer holds: pass 5.\nNo whole-run budgets.\n\n[[Run Lifecycle Design]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "submit",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 1 · Save user message\n\nRefresh temporary inactivity on submission.\nDoes this chat already have an active run?\n\nNo duplicate jobs for the same chat.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "steer",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Steer existing work\n\nRetain original task/history.\nAppend messages in order.\nStop/cleanup takes precedence.\n\n[[Run Lifecycle - Steering.canvas]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "queue",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 2 · Queue when busy\n\nWait for project/model capacity.\nFIFO among eligible work.\nShow reason + live position + Cancel.\nKeep pending messages in order.\nDo not hold model capacity for a busy project.",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "start",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 3 · Validate and start\n\nRecheck location/context/access.\nKeep stable run/location identity.\nReserve within the repository project.\nRefresh permissions on each request/action.\nAcquire capacity per model request.",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "work",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 4 · Model → tools → model\n\nOne active run in this chat.\nSequential tool calls initially.\nRelease model capacity during tools.\nOther eligible chats can work concurrently.",
      "x": 1660,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "approval",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Waiting for approval\n\nRetain chat/project reservation.\nFree model-request capacity.\nApproval never becomes automatic consent.\nApproval-only temporary waits count down.\n\n[[Run Lifecycle - Approvals.canvas]]",
      "x": 1660,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "settle",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 5 · Settle before release\n\nStop cancels work and keeps edits.\nWait for owned writers; record actual outcome.\nOnly genuine uncertainty blocks affected writes.\n\n[[Run Lifecycle - Stop & Retained Edits.canvas]]",
      "x": 2240,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "advance",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 6 · Advance eligible queue\n\nRelease ownership after safe settlement.\nStart the next eligible chat.\nRevalidate before it starts.\nCancelled/deleted chats cannot restart.",
      "x": 2840,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "cancel",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Cancel before starting\n\nRemove the queue entry.\nKeep saved messages marked unprocessed.\nNo repository edits to restore.\nEligible Keep/move is available before a run starts.",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "expiry",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Temporary queued work\n\nQueued messages/model requests hold 1:00:00.\nActive model/tool work also holds it.\nIdle or approval-only waits count down.\nCancel last job → fresh idle hour.\n\n[[Run Lifecycle - Temporary Expiry.canvas]]",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "limits",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## No whole-run budgets\n\nFirst iteration: no fixed or optional total time, step or tool-call caps.\nWork finishes or encounters actual model/provider constraints or user Stop.\nOperation/context/output boundaries remain.",
      "x": 2240,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "shared",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Concurrent shared updates\n\nSerialize memory/notes changes per resource.\nCheck revisions; preserve other writers.\nNo whole-file overwrite from an old copy.\n\n[[Memory & Context Policy]]",
      "x": 2840,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "queue_position",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Live queue positions\n\n“Queued for local model — 2nd in line.”\nPosition 1 = next waiting entry.\nUpdate when work starts/cancels.\nLabel the queue; no invented host rank.",
      "x": 520,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "host_capacity",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Respect host/model capacity\n\nNo parallel support → one request at a time.\nSeveral chats can wait in the queue.\nShare capacity across chats/agents.\nUnknown host rank → show unavailable.",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "2"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "q1",
      "fromNode": "submit",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "queue",
      "toSide": "left",
      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "New work"
    },
    {
